{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposals result in a net loss of employment floorspace and it has not been demonstrated through the submission of sound evidence and rigorous marketing that there is no quantitative or qualitative need for a range of employment uses, contrary to Policy CS11 and DM17 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012.",
    "The retrospective change of use and external alterations would be an incongruous addition to the host building that would be visually intrusive in the streetscene and detract from the character and appearance of the host property and the surrounding area. As such the proposal would not accord with policies CS8 and DM10 of the Council's adopted LDF Core Strategy April 2012 and Policy D3 of the London Plan 2021.",
    "The proposed layout would result in an impractical internal arrangement with inadequate outlook, privacy, and natural daylight, failing to provide an acceptable standard of accommodation for future occupants, contrary to Policies CS8 and DM10 of the LDF Core Strategy 2012 and guidance within the Residential Design Guide SPD (2013)."
  ],
